        "category": "classfeature",
        "description": {
            "value": "<p>You study flesh up close by clashing blade against bone. You gain the reaper's edge and thrall teamwork abilities.</p>\n<p><strong>Reaper's Edge</strong> You become trained in martial weapons and medium armor. At 11th level, you become an expert in martial weapons, and at 13th you become an expert in medium armor.</p>\n<p><strong>Thrall Teamwork</strong> Once per round after you cast Create Thrall, you can make a melee Strike as a free action against a creature within your melee reach that is adjacent to at least one of your thralls.</p>"
